      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Dwarves are such imaginative creatures, yes? You've seen their airships, weapons, tools. Nimbari take more from them than we like to admit.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447331,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But imagination has its dark side; as dreams become more vivid, so too do nightmares. And the Chain of Myth and Storm makes them real.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447331,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Usually this just makes an extra Ox or two, a Meowl here or there. But the breaking of the Athanor Chain shook all of Empyrea.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447331,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Dwarves felt it more than most. They cover with bravado and jocularity, but under it all, so deep even they can't see it, they are terrified.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447331,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I am adept at reading the fear in others' eyes; it's all I see in the Dwarves. And the Chain's Myth Strand is bringing their fears to life.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_HelenaF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Helena_EM2_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447331,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
